WEBVTT

00:05:59.605 --> 00:06:02.149
(Laughter)

00:06:02.191 --> 00:06:05.403
Because we already have
most of the solutions we need.

00:06:05.403 --> 00:06:07.738
We need to get to work
and to pick up the pace.

00:06:07.738 --> 00:06:10.241
We need to build the biggest,
strongest team possible

00:06:10.241 --> 00:06:15.454
to tackle this most enormous challenge
humanity has ever faced.

00:06:16.205 --> 00:06:19.583
Another word I love
that is perfect for this moment

00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:20.960
is leaderful.

00:06:21.335 --> 00:06:24.046
I learned this term
from Black Lives Matter activists

00:06:24.088 --> 00:06:26.465
who use it as an organizing principle.

00:06:26.757 --> 00:06:29.093
Social movements can be fragile

00:06:29.135 --> 00:06:31.929
when they're helmed
by a few prominent leaders.